      <span class="blog-cat-tag" style="background:#1a3a5c;">GAS SAFETY</span>
      <h1 class="blog-title">The Silent Killer in Liverpool Homes: A Practical Carbon Monoxide Guide</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Faulty gas appliances can give off carbon monoxide. You cannot see it, smell it or taste it. Here is what every Liverpool homeowner and landlord needs to know to keep people safe.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
        <span><strong>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</strong></span>
        <span>Published April 2026</span>
        <span>Updated 26 November 2026</span>
        <span>5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
